Package: hawkesNet
Title: Simulate and Fit Maximum Likelihood for Hawkesian Network Growth Models
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Duncan A. Clark
Maintainer: Duncan A. Clark <dac6@williams.edu>
Authors@R: 
    person("Duncan", "Clark", , "dac6@williams.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0000-0000-0000"))
Description: Provides tools for simulating and fitting Hawkes-process-driven
    network growth models via maximum likelihood.
    Supports both homogeneous and inhomogeneous (KDE-estimated) background
    rates, Barabási--Albert and change-statistic (ERNM) mark distributions,
    parallel intensity-cache construction, and goodness-of-fit diagnostics.
